    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm currently drafting a report for our board regarding a potential shift in our manufacturing footprint. We're looking at moving some of our mid-tier production lines out of our current hubs. Can you help me put together a comparative risk assessment for labor forces in Eastern Europe vs. Southeast Asia and Sub-Saharan Africa? I need to look at things like general reliability, skill levels, and how much management oversight is typically needed in those regions.",
